{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":6},"Le Plaisir du désordre","Ève Bonfanti et Yves Hunstad sont belges, comédiens et auteurs. Ils écrivent des pièces fascinantes d’intelligence, de poésie et de drôlerie. Le film se propose d’entrer dans le mystère de cette écriture, en suivant le dialogue qui s’instaure entre eux lors de l’élaboration de leur nouveau spectacle, une variation sur le bonheur, ou comment continuer à vivre ensemble dans un monde qui se déchire ?",[4,5],"artistic creation","self-employment",{"type":7,"id":8,"slug":9,"title":10,"release":12,"filmType":16,"directors":17,"genre":26,"media":28,"synopsis":31,"production":32,"characters":38,"roles":39,"awards":51,"tags":3},"Film","FR2017_205","fr2017-205-le-plaisir-du-desordre",{"native":1,"english":11},"",{"type":13,"date":14,"year":15},"Theatrical release","2017-01-01",2017,"Documentary",[18],{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":25},"Christian Rouaud","christian-rouaud",1948,0,"Male identifying","France",[],[27],"Documentary – Observational mode",{"posterUrl":29,"trailerUrl":30},"https://www.entre2prises.fr/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/plaisir-du-desordre-projo.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=glJ-3X2oCnA",{"native":2,"english":11},[33,35],{"country":24,"share":34},"Majority coproducer",{"country":36,"share":37},"Belgium","Minority coproducer",[],[40,44],{"person":41,"role":43},{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":42},[],"Director of the film",{"person":45,"role":50},{"id":46,"slug":47,"name":46,"birthYear":48,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":36,"awards":49},"Yves Hunstad","yves-hunstad",1956,[],"Documentary subject",[]],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
